{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"Hello！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/03/11/4901018/0000.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"３月11日！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日の一年前！\n多くの方々に被害を与えた東日本大震災！\nこの地震で家族や友達！家など大事なものうばいとった大震災！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今でも思い出したら不安！恐怖になるかたもいるとおもいます！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"でも皆で心を１つにし！\n復興し続けてる今！\n今の私に何かできることを考えて！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"一人でも多くの方に不安！恐怖の気持ちを柔らげる事ができたらいいなと思います！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"貴方のその優しい心で協力し！心を１つにして復興できたらと思います！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今！こんなにも復興出来たのはその優しいこころがあったからだと思います！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"この気持ちを忘れず！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"東日本をスマイルイッパイの元気な日本にしたいです！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"明日も幸せな一日が皆様に訪れますように！\nBye"}],"source":"archive"}